**D. Which agents count.**

Sources: group Rd3 title "INDEX.md fits every agent that reads it"; prose "the strictest start-file limit of the agents that read it"; Rd3.1a "among the agents that work on the project". Question: which set? agents that read INDEX.md at session start, or all agents that work on the project?

