Rules: #2 (make yourself unbeatable first; do not rely on the enemy not coming / rely on having the means) — carrying the check is the "means"; #3 (whole over broken) — a kit with a missing checker is broken; #12 (choose the ground, not the people) — pinning the tool removes reliance on each project installing the right version. Good.

