Cost for E: a tool schema + parser + tests (a day?), re-copy to projects; measurement runs each engine once per version, plus non-determinism (version drift, budget shared with other files); the 12k-char agy row may force the interim 24,000 bytes down to 12,000 chars, i.e. the tool would fail existing indexes — good, but it may block a project, so measure before relying.

